{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Hello. ","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^Hello. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Is that starfish still there? ","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^Yes. Meow.","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Of course he is. ","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^He’s there every second of everyday. ","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^Eating and eating.","\n","^...meow.","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^He never moves.","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^He keeps that best spot for himself. ","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^Selfish is what he is.","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^Haha, meow.","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^And you know the worst thing? ","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^All that food that falls down...","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^it’s shellfish! My people he’s eating! (MORE)","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^Revenge, one day I’ll get my revenge.","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^Sorry, meow.","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Aah, look at that pretty light. ","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^The only thing that calms me.","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^I collect it you see.","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^You collect light?","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Yes!","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^I don’t think that’s possible.","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Well I do it, so it must be.","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n","^...okay meow.","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Revenge!","#","^speaker: Shellfish","/#","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}